{"type":"Feature","id":"mkdb-98","properties":{"name":"Richmond, VA","date":"2006-01-01","killed":7,"injured":0,"offenders":2,"weapon":"Stabbing, Strangulation","situation":"Robbery","incident_type":"Felony","location_type":"Residence","tract":"Census Tract 404","acs_period":"2006-2010","pct_poverty_tract":51.859100341796875,"median_income_tract":16339,"summary":"Jan 1, 2006: 7 killed. Richmond, VA.\nCause: Stabbing, Strangulation · Type: Felony · Circumstance: Robbery · Location: Residence · Offenders: 2\nRicky Gray, 28, was convicted of murdering a family of four during a burglary. His nephew, Ray Dandridge, 28, assisted. A week later, both men killed a family of three. Dandridge was convicted in that case and was given a life sentence. Gray also confess\nCensus Tract 404 (ACS 2006-2010): 51.9% in poverty, median household income $16,339, 83.1% white, 5.3% Black, 2.8% Hispanic/Latino, 20.6% vacant housing.","nearest_trauma_center":"Vcu Medical Center - Main","nearest_trauma_level":"Level I","nearest_trauma_km":3.01,"nearest_trauma_miles":1.87,"nearest_level1_center":"Vcu Medical Center - Main","nearest_level1_km":3.01,"nearest_level1_miles":1.87,"source_note":"Mass Killing Database (MKDB), 2006–2023: incidents with 4 or more killed; tract context from ACS 5-year estimates."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-77.460258,37.553757]}}
{"type":"Feature","id":"mkdb-109","properties":{"name":"Goleta, CA","date":"2006-01-30","killed":7,"injured":0,"offenders":1,"weapon":"Shooting","situation":"Employment grievance","incident_type":"Public","location_type":"Government/Transit","tract":"Census Tract 30.01","acs_period":"2006-2010","pct_poverty_tract":15.628790855407715,"median_income_tract":49007,"summary":"Jan 30, 2006: 7 killed. Goleta, CA.\nCause: Shooting · Type: Public · Circumstance: Employment grievance · Location: Government/Transit · Offenders: 1\nThree years after disability retirement for psychological problems, Jennifer Sanmarco, 44, killed a former neighbor. She then returned to her postal workplace and fatally shot six people before killing herself, all with a legally purchased handgun.\nCensus Tract 30.01 (ACS 2006-2010): 15.6% in poverty, median household income $49,007, 36.4% white, 2.1% Black, 57.4% Hispanic/Latino, 3.1% vacant housing.","nearest_trauma_center":"Santa Barbara Cottage Hospital","nearest_trauma_level":"Level I","nearest_trauma_km":9.55,"nearest_trauma_miles":5.93,"nearest_level1_center":"Santa Barbara Cottage Hospital","nearest_level1_km":9.55,"nearest_level1_miles":5.93,"source_note":"Mass Killing Database (MKDB), 2006–2023: incidents with 4 or more killed; tract context from ACS 5-year estimates."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-119.827637,34.435829]}}
