{"type":"Feature","id":"mkdb-270","properties":{"name":"Charleston, SC","date":"2015-06-17","killed":9,"injured":1,"offenders":1,"weapon":"Shooting","situation":"Hate","incident_type":"Public","location_type":"House of worship","tract":"Census Tract 7, Charleston County, South Carolina","acs_period":"2011-2015","pct_poverty_tract":55.76036834716797,"median_income_tract":22262,"summary":"Jun 17, 2015: 9 killed, 1 injured. Charleston, SC.\nCause: Shooting · Type: Public · Circumstance: Hate · Location: House of worship · Offenders: 1\nA white gunman killed nine people, including a pastor, attending a prayer meeting at a historic black church. Dylann Storm Roof, 21, was charged with murder and federal hate crimes. He was convicted and sentenced to death.\nCensus Tract 7, Charleston County, South Carolina (ACS 2011-2015): 55.8% in poverty, median household income $22,262, 70.4% white, 20.7% Black, 3.5% Hispanic/Latino, 13.6% vacant housing.","nearest_trauma_center":"Musc Medical Center","nearest_trauma_level":"Level I","nearest_trauma_km":1.4,"nearest_trauma_miles":0.87,"nearest_level1_center":"Musc Medical Center","nearest_level1_km":1.4,"nearest_level1_miles":0.87,"source_note":"Mass Killing Database (MKDB), 2006–2023: incidents with 4 or more killed; tract context from ACS 5-year estimates."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-79.933083,32.787498]}}
