{"type":"Feature","id":"mkdb-272","properties":{"name":"Chattanooga, TN","date":"2015-07-16","killed":5,"injured":2,"offenders":1,"weapon":"Shooting","situation":"Terrorism","incident_type":"Public","location_type":"Government/Transit","tract":"Census Tract 32, Hamilton County, Tennessee","acs_period":"2011-2015","pct_poverty_tract":21.055635452270508,"median_income_tract":38313,"summary":"Jul 16, 2015: 5 killed, 2 injured. Chattanooga, TN.\nCause: Shooting · Type: Public · Circumstance: Terrorism · Location: Government/Transit · Offenders: 1\nFour Marines and a Naval officer died when a gunman attacked a military training center after having shot up a military recruitment office earlier. Mohammod Youssuf Abdulazeez, 24, was killed by a police officer at the scene.\nCensus Tract 32, Hamilton County, Tennessee (ACS 2011-2015): 21.1% in poverty, median household income $38,313, 19.3% white, 69.5% Black, 3.5% Hispanic/Latino, 15.2% vacant housing.","nearest_trauma_center":"Erlanger Medical Center","nearest_trauma_level":"Level I","nearest_trauma_km":4.61,"nearest_trauma_miles":2.87,"nearest_level1_center":"Erlanger Medical Center","nearest_level1_km":4.61,"nearest_level1_miles":2.87,"source_note":"Mass Killing Database (MKDB), 2006–2023: incidents with 4 or more killed; tract context from ACS 5-year estimates."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-85.242096,35.062263]}}
