{"type":"Feature","id":"mkdb-538","properties":{"name":"Moscow, ID","date":"2022-11-13","killed":4,"injured":0,"offenders":1,"weapon":"Stabbing","situation":"","incident_type":"Other","location_type":"Residence","tract":"Census Tract 54, Latah County, Idaho","acs_period":"2017-2021","pct_poverty_tract":23.489309310913086,"median_income_tract":37924,"summary":"Nov 13, 2022: 4 killed. Moscow, ID.\nCause: Stabbing · Type: Other · Location: Residence · Offenders: 1\nFour University of Idaho students were found fatally stabbed in an off-campus apartment, while two others  slept through the attack and were unharmed.  A 28-year-old doctoral student at Washington State University was arrested in connection to the crime.\nCensus Tract 54, Latah County, Idaho (ACS 2017-2021): 23.5% in poverty, median household income $37,924, 85.6% white, 1.5% Black, 4.5% Hispanic/Latino, 10.8% vacant housing.","nearest_trauma_center":"Gritman Medical Center","nearest_trauma_level":"Level IV","nearest_trauma_km":1.05,"nearest_trauma_miles":0.65,"nearest_level1_center":"Uw Medicine - Harborview Medical Center","nearest_level1_km":413.41,"nearest_level1_miles":256.88,"source_note":"Mass Killing Database (MKDB), 2006–2023: incidents with 4 or more killed; tract context from ACS 5-year estimates."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-117.010712,46.721909]}}
